// stdlib/ai/post_transformer_parallel_antifragile.sapp
// PBLang v5.2.0 — Sovereign Post-Transformer Parallel & Anti-Fragile AI Architecture.
// 100% Pure PBLang (.sapp) with Real Multi-Core OS Threads (spawn/join) and Optional Live GPU Dispatch.
